  "notes": "Crumb's Ovens, dressed by trade (round 8, 8J): the counter line across the south of the shop (three glazed bread cases, Tamsin's shop counter with its lamp, the ledger on the stone end), the day's bake on shelves along the back wall between the four station doors with the peels and the price slate, a stub wall of racks and a shaping table along the baker's side, cooling racks and baskets beside the Wake Table, the oven on its flagged hearth with the dead's three loaves on the ledge, sacks and a barrel in the store corner, a settle for the queue. The Wake Table, plates, dead loaves and ledger of the removed quick mode stay frozen (GDD 3.11, A115); in the main match a task node (Fetch the flour) and a Blood-wash basin.",
